#, python-format
msgctxt "admin.mythic_track_on"
msgid ""
"✅ Mythic Track has been turned **on** for this server!\n"
"\n"
"To continue setup, please [connect your Discord account to Mythic Track](%(guide)s).\n"
"\n"
"While this feature is turned on, SpellBot will generate PIN codes for players to enter into Mythic Track so that their games can be tracked."
msgstr ""
"✅ ¡Mythic Track se ha **activado** en este servidor!\n"
"\n"
"Para continuar con la configuración, [vincule su cuenta de Discord con Mythic Track](%(guide)s).\n"
"\n"
"Mientras tenga esta función activada, SpellBot generará códigos PIN para que los jugadores entren en Mythic Track para permitir el seguimiento de sus partidas."

msgctxt "admin.mythic_track_off"
msgid "❌ Mythic Track has been turned **off** for this server. Rerun this command to toggle it back on. Note that turning this feature off does _not_ remove any existing Mythic Track data."
msgstr "❌ Mythic Track se ha **desactivado** en este servidor. Vuelva a ejecutar este comando para activarlo. Tenga en cuenta que, al desactivar esta opción, _no_ se eliminan datos de Mythic Track."

